*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% BradyBBP12.ppd - Open driver for the Brady BBP12 thermal label printer.
*% Raster is converted to TSPL by /Library/Printers/Brady/Filters/rastertobradybbp12.
*%
*% Copyright (c) 2026 SeeBubble Media FlexCo - Martin Bundschuh
*% Released under the MIT License.
*% https://github.com/CodeNinjaGuy/brady-bbp12-macos-driver
*%
*% Independent driver. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Brady Corporation.
*%
*FormatVersion:	"4.3"
*FileVersion:	"1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName:	"BBP12.PPD"
*Manufacturer:	"Brady"
*Product:	"(BBP12)"
*ModelName:	"Brady BBP12"
*ShortNickName:	"Brady BBP12 TSPL"
*NickName:	"Brady BBP12 TSPL (SeeBubble Media FlexCo)"
*PSVersion:	"(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel:	"3"
*ColorDevice:	False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem:	False
*Throughput:	"8"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer:	Type42

*cupsVersion:	1.2
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter:	"application/vnd.cups-raster 50 /Library/Printers/Brady/Filters/rastertobradybbp12"

*% ==== Resolution ====================================================

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ==== Colour model ==================================================

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel RGB/Color source (converted): "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% ==== Media sizes ===================================================

*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth:  "306"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1728"

*NonUIOrderDependency: 100 AnySetup *CustomPageSize
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop
<</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*End
*ParamCustomPageSize Width:        1 points 12 306
*ParamCustomPageSize Height:       2 points 12 1728
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset:  3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation:  5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w241h57
*PageSize w241h57/85 x 20 mm: "<</PageSize[241 57]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w142h71/50 x 25 mm: "<</PageSize[142 71]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w71h71/25 x 25 mm: "<</PageSize[71 71]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w176h82/62 x 29 mm: "<</PageSize[176 82]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w283h142/100 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[283 142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w283h425/100 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w241h57
*PageRegion w241h57/85 x 20 mm: "<</PageSize[241 57]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w142h71/50 x 25 mm: "<</PageSize[142 71]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w71h71/25 x 25 mm: "<</PageSize[71 71]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w176h82/62 x 29 mm: "<</PageSize[176 82]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w283h142/100 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[283 142]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w283h425/100 x 150 mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w241h57
*ImageableArea w241h57/85 x 20 mm: "0 0 241 57"
*ImageableArea w142h71/50 x 25 mm: "0 0 142 71"
*ImageableArea w71h71/25 x 25 mm: "0 0 71 71"
*ImageableArea w176h82/62 x 29 mm: "0 0 176 82"
*ImageableArea w283h142/100 x 50 mm: "0 0 283 142"
*ImageableArea w283h425/100 x 150 mm: "0 0 283 425"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w241h57
*PaperDimension w241h57/85 x 20 mm: "241 57"
*PaperDimension w142h71/50 x 25 mm: "142 71"
*PaperDimension w71h71/25 x 25 mm: "71 71"
*PaperDimension w176h82/62 x 29 mm: "176 82"
*PaperDimension w283h142/100 x 50 mm: "283 142"
*PaperDimension w283h425/100 x 150 mm: "283 425"

*% ==== Thermal printer settings ======================================

*OpenGroup: Brady/Brady BBP12 Settings

*OpenUI *BradyMediaType/Media Handling: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyMediaType
*DefaultBradyMediaType: Gap
*BradyMediaType Gap/Die-cut labels (gap sensor): ""
*BradyMediaType Continuous/Continuous media (no gap): ""
*BradyMediaType BlackMark/Black mark sensor: ""
*CloseUI: *BradyMediaType

*OpenUI *BradyGap/Gap or Mark Height (mm): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyGap
*DefaultBradyGap: 3
*BradyGap 0/0 mm: ""
*BradyGap 2/2 mm: ""
*BradyGap 3/3 mm: ""
*BradyGap 4/4 mm: ""
*BradyGap 6/6 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *BradyGap
*CustomBradyGap True/Custom: ""
*ParamCustomBradyGap Text: 1 string 1 8

*OpenUI *BradySensorOffset/Gap Offset (mm): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradySensorOffset
*DefaultBradySensorOffset: 0
*BradySensorOffset 0/0 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *BradySensorOffset
*CustomBradySensorOffset True/Custom: ""
*ParamCustomBradySensorOffset Text: 1 string 1 8

*OpenUI *BradyRibbon/Print Method: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyRibbon
*DefaultBradyRibbon: On
*BradyRibbon On/Thermal transfer (ribbon): ""
*BradyRibbon Off/Direct thermal (no ribbon): ""
*CloseUI: *BradyRibbon

*OpenUI *BradyDensity/Print Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyDensity
*DefaultBradyDensity: 8
*BradyDensity 0/0 (lightest): ""
*BradyDensity 2/2: ""
*BradyDensity 4/4: ""
*BradyDensity 6/6: ""
*BradyDensity 8/8 (default): ""
*BradyDensity 10/10: ""
*BradyDensity 12/12: ""
*BradyDensity 15/15 (darkest): ""
*CloseUI: *BradyDensity

*OpenUI *BradySpeed/Print Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradySpeed
*DefaultBradySpeed: 2
*BradySpeed 2/2 ips: ""
*BradySpeed 3/3 ips: ""
*BradySpeed 4/4 ips: ""
*BradySpeed 5/5 ips: ""
*CloseUI: *BradySpeed

*OpenUI *BradyDither/Halftoning: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyDither
*DefaultBradyDither: Threshold
*BradyDither Threshold/Sharp (text and barcodes): ""
*BradyDither Diffusion/Error diffusion (photos and logos): ""
*CloseUI: *BradyDither

*OpenUI *BradyThreshold/Black Threshold: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyThreshold
*DefaultBradyThreshold: 128
*BradyThreshold 96/96 (thinner): ""
*BradyThreshold 128/128 (default): ""
*BradyThreshold 160/160: ""
*BradyThreshold 192/192 (bolder): ""
*CloseUI: *BradyThreshold

*OpenUI *BradyDirection/Feed Direction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyDirection
*DefaultBradyDirection: 1
*BradyDirection 1/Normal: ""
*BradyDirection 0/Rotated 180 degrees: ""
*CloseUI: *BradyDirection

*OpenUI *BradyMirror/Mirror Image: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyMirror
*DefaultBradyMirror: 0
*BradyMirror 0/Off: ""
*BradyMirror 1/On: ""
*CloseUI: *BradyMirror

*OpenUI *BradyXOffset/Horizontal Shift (dots): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyXOffset
*DefaultBradyXOffset: 0
*BradyXOffset 0/0: ""
*CloseUI: *BradyXOffset
*CustomBradyXOffset True/Custom: ""
*ParamCustomBradyXOffset Text: 1 string 1 8

*OpenUI *BradyYOffset/Vertical Shift (dots): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *BradyYOffset
*DefaultBradyYOffset: 0
*BradyYOffset 0/0: ""
*CloseUI: *BradyYOffset
*CustomBradyYOffset True/Custom: ""
*ParamCustomBradyYOffset Text: 1 string 1 8

*CloseGroup: Brady

*% End of BradyBBP12.ppd
